  nombre="Legal notice"
  descripcion="Terms of use of Mejor Eléctrico: who is responsible for the site, how its content can be used and the scope of the information published."
  actualizado="2026-10-19"
>
  <p>
    This notice governs access to and use of the website <strong>mejorelectrico.com</strong> (hereinafter, "the site").
    Anyone who enters and uses the site becomes a user and accepts these terms. If you do not agree with them, you must
