    <li><strong>Web address:</strong> https://mejorelectrico.com</li>
    <li><strong>Registered address:</strong> {DOMICILIO}</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${CORREO_CONTACTO}`}>{CORREO_CONTACTO}</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Purpose of the site</h2>
  <p>
    Mejor Eléctrico is a digital publication about vehicles. It offers informative articles (news, launches, guides and
