    carefully, they may contain errors or omissions. Before buying a vehicle or making an important decision, confirm
    the data with the manufacturer or with the dealer in your country.
  </p>
  <p>
    The scores in the comparison tool are a guide calculated from the available data. They are not a purchase
    recommendation and do not take price into account.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The texts, design, code, comparison charts and the Mejor Eléctrico brand belong to their owner or are used with
    authorization, and are protected by the applicable copyright and industrial property rules.
  </p>
  <p>
    Vehicle photographs belong to their manufacturers or their authors, and are published with credit, as press material
    or under free licenses. The brands and model names mentioned belong to their respective owners and are cited only to
    identify the products.
  </p>
  <p>
