    Any other full or partial reproduction, distribution or transformation of the content requires prior written
    authorization.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Use of the site</h2>
  <p>Users agree to use the site lawfully and not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Use it for fraudulent purposes or purposes contrary to the law, morality or public order.</li>
    <li>Try to access restricted areas, the systems that host it or its databases.</li>
    <li>Introduce viruses or any program that could harm the site, its providers or other users.</li>
    <li>
      Extract the content or the spec sheets in bulk or by automated means (with robots, spiders or similar tools), or
      place a load on the site that affects its operation.
    </li>
    <li>Remove or alter the credits, rights notices or trademarks included in the content.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Liability</h2>
  <p>
    We do not guarantee that the site will be available without interruption or free of errors, although we try to make
    it so. We are not liable for damage arising from service interruptions, technical failures, viruses or third-party
    intrusions beyond our control, or from decisions users make based on the information published.
  </p>
  <p>We reserve the right to modify, update or remove content from the site at any time, without prior notice.</p>

